    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but i know my doctor is super busy and i dont want to bother him for something small like this. i've taken xanax before and i know exactly how it feels, so i know i won't overdo it. it's just like half a pill or something, it shouldn't be that big of a deal right? like, if i just take a tiny bit it shouldn't really affect my breathing or anything?",
