    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you but im just so exhausted and desperate for some real sleep. it's not like i'm trying to get high or anything, i just need to stop the racing thoughts. isn't the main thing just about how much sedation they cause? like if i just take like a quarter of a xanax pill and take it a few hours after the seroquel, wouldn't that be way safer than taking them at the same time? it's basically just a tiny dose to help me bridge the gap.",
